# P5.6 Dose Verification Sandbox — all generated/regenerable artifacts (snapshot export,
# pilot report, QA issue log, golden dataset dump, semantic store). Regenerate via
# `python -m dose_verification_sandbox.snapshot` / `.pilot` / `.golden` / `.semantics_store`.
/dose_verification_sandbox/data/*.json
/dose_verification_sandbox/data/*.md
/dose_verification_sandbox/data/*.sqlite

